| VAr Tools | VAr Tools | VAr_Tools.md | VAr Tools |
| Camera Resolution | Resolution Manager | camera-resolution-manager.md | Camera Resolution Manager |
| Object Renamer PRO | Object Renamer PRO | object-renamer-pro.md | Object Renamer PRO |
| Snapshot | Snapshot | snapshot.md | Snapshot |
